{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_12107130","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12107130","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:4:1210713001:0":{"text":"제... 제발 저희 좀 살려주세요!","source_cn":"求……求你放过我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x22DE2195D077A29A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1210713002:0":{"text":"하하하, 부족해! 더 비굴하고 절망적이게 빌어봐!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈，不够！再叫得更惨一点，更绝望一点！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08A35EB4A76113C1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1210713003:0":{"text":"... 제발... 살려주세요!","source_cn":"——求求你——放过我们！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9895E714D7C0D454","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1210713004:0":{"text":"이런 멍청이들, 울부짖을 줄도 모르다니!","source_cn":"两个废物，惨叫都叫不出声。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC066FA242B69A0C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1210713005:0":{"text":"살고 싶어? 그럼 기회를 주지.","source_cn":"想活吗？我给你们机会。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E089E7F6DE49701","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1210713006:0":{"text":"여기 약물이 한 병 있어. 둘 중 한 명이 약물을 마시면, 다른 한 명은 살려주지.","source_cn":"这里有一瓶药水，你们选个人喝下去，我就把另一个放了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x187F1E62D1C3F0F5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1210713007:0":{"text":"...마시면 어떻게 되는데요?","source_cn":"……喝了会怎么样？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57908C7A337A9E89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1210713008:0":{"text":"그건~ 너희가 마셔봐야 알겠지?","source_cn":"喏~你们自己看。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD09A63D57E8C8F8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1210713009:0":{"text":"크르릉!","source_cn":"吼——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1115B6D8CB85973D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1210713010:0":{"text":"...저렇게 변하는 거라면 죽는 거랑 뭐가 다르죠?","source_cn":"……变成这样，和死了有什么区别？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD677AF4E204D41EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1210713011:0":{"text":"한 명이 죽는 걸 선택할지, 둘이 같이 죽을지 궁금하니까?","source_cn":"就看你们是选死一个，还是一起死咯？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x244FC84C358CAB25","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1210713012:0":{"text":"당신은 악마야... 악마!","source_cn":"你是个恶魔……恶魔！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x082C0652A748AD7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1210713013:0":{"text":"하하하! 그녀를 위해 죽을 수 있다면서?","source_cn":"哈哈哈！你不是说可以为她去死吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD32E04B1745E469E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1210713014:0":{"text":"소원을 이룰 기회를 주는 건데, 나한테 감사해야지, 안 그래?! 하하하!","source_cn":"我给你实现愿望的机会，为什么不感谢我？感谢我呀！哈哈哈哈！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x02FC8D9E6B3323D6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1210713015:0":{"text":"제발 부탁이에요... 살려주세요...","source_cn":"求求你……放过我们吧……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB1F63EAE7EEDAC2D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1210713016:0":{"text":"못 고르겠으면, 대신 선택해 달라고 할까?","source_cn":"不选的话，我就让它帮你们选了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31AA40BE14FA9724","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1210713017:0":{"text":"구... 구...","source_cn":"咕……叽……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CC36F49F69E5BD1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:32:1210713018:0":{"text":"라이아, 내가... 당신 대신 죽음을 선택하겠어, 내가 마실게!","source_cn":"拉亚，我……我愿意为了你去死，让我喝吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x352AE68BCD7FA058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1210713019:0":{"text":"티르, 한 명만 살 수 있다면 나는 그게 당신이길 바라요! 내가 마실게요!","source_cn":"提尔，如果只能活一个，我宁愿是你！让我喝！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8586F94BD9496342","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:34:1210713020:0":{"text":"당신이 죽으면 내가 살아서 무슨 의미가 있겠어?","source_cn":"你要是死了，我活着还有什么意思？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA4538881F2716C2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1210713021:0":{"text":"그럼 같이 마셔요! 약 주세요!","source_cn":"那就一起喝吧！把药给我们！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF9E82469EDD9519","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:37:1210713022:0":{"text":"결국, 두 사람은 함께 약물을 마셨다...","source_cn":"两人一起喝下了药水……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF94749EB4B9005C8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1210713023:0":{"text":"티르, 죽음마저도 우리를 떼어낼 수 없어요...","source_cn":"提尔，这下连死亡都没法分开我们了……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC740B4C5B9D803C0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1210713024:0":{"text":"흑흑, 라이아, 미, 미안해...","source_cn":"咳咳，拉亚，我……对不起……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x332D1A7AEB638D0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1210713025:0":{"text":"약을... 안 마신 거예요? 나를 속인 건가요?!!","source_cn":"你——你刚才没有把药水咽下去？你在骗我？！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF2D7B74186F4B26D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1210713026:0":{"text":"미안해... 하지만... 나는 살고 싶어.","source_cn":"对不起，但是……我想活下去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x802918DF8D3EFD29","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1210713027:0":{"text":"나를 위해 죽을 수도 있다면서요?!! 이런 거짓말쟁이!!!","source_cn":"你还说愿意为我死？！！你骗我！！！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x46E23856A1163679","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1210713028:0":{"text":"아하하...! 이런 드라마는 언제봐도 재밌다니까.","source_cn":"啊哈哈哈……！这样的戏码，无论看多少次，都不会厌烦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x116190EDA6C1ED77","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1210713029:0":{"text":"바닷물 맛은 어땠어? 너무 써서 눈물도 안 나지?","source_cn":"海水好喝吗？有没有苦到连眼泪都流不出来？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9ECA1CC443AC5CE1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1210713030:0":{"text":"이... 이게 바닷물이라고?","source_cn":"这、这只是海水？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABF921BF20AB5A47","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1210713031:0":{"text":"우리를 속인 건가요?","source_cn":"我们被骗了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DA7CB22E25812E4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1210713032:0":{"text":"하하하! 너무 순진한 거 아니야? 너를 위해 죽겠다는 그런 거짓말을 진짜 믿을 줄이야!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈哈哈！谁让你们天真，居然相信什么愿意为你去死的谎话！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBD0803DD2B095281","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:55:1210714001:":{"text":"어이...! 엿듣는 놈, 이제 나오시지?!","source_cn":"喂……！偷听的，滚出来！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE20C4133D5042AB0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:59:1210715001:0":{"text":"아, 너구나. 남의 대화 엿듣는 걸 좋아하나 봐?","source_cn":"啊，是你。你很喜欢偷听吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C517411FDC63387","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:60:1210715002:0":{"text":"나라, 넌 방금 두 개의 재료를 허비했어.","source_cn":"奈拉，你浪费了两个材料。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DBB0A7EA4C71D0C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1210715003:0":{"text":"내가 잡은 녀석들이니까 내 마음대로 할 거야. 선장이 그래도 된다고 했어!","source_cn":"那两个家伙是我抓的，任我处置，船长说我有这个权利！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3123D32DEE8B70FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1210715004:0":{"text":"... 곧 결전의 날이야. 선장이 진귀한 힘을 너에게 썼으니, 실망시키지 마.","source_cn":"……决战日快到了，船长把那么珍贵的力量用在了你身上，别...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD71967AFD3995192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1210715005:0":{"text":"잔소리 그만해! 지겨워 죽겠으니까.","source_cn":"真吵啊，这些话早都听腻了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE728BA3013531394","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1210715006:0":{"text":"내가 봤을 땐... 선장이 실망할까 봐 두려워하는 건 너 같은데?","source_cn":"我看是你……很害怕让他失望吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x86E62FD4F2B111B0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1210715007:0":{"text":"웃기시네!","source_cn":"真是无礼！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0FFEFBE70716054B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1210715008:0":{"text":"선장이 말리지 않았다면 진작에 네 머리를 몇 번이고 베어서 갈고리에 걸어놨을 거야. 얼마나 재밌을까!","source_cn":"要不是船长拦着，你的头早被我割下来十次了。串在钩索上会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5471649283677E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1210715009:0":{"text":"됐어. 난 분명히 알려줬으니, 네가 알아서 해.","source_cn":"够了。该提醒的我都提醒了，你好自为之。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4E394BC5EA7770BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:68:1210715010:0":{"text":"아하하. 잘 가!","source_cn":"啊哈哈，慢走！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF1C5E713267DA6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1210715011:0":{"text":"이봐, 이 두 사람을... 어디 보자...","source_cn":"来人，把这两个人……我想想……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70357E2E39BF2BF3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:71:1210715012:0":{"text":"남자는 매달고, 밧줄은 여자에게 줘.","source_cn":"男的吊起来，绳子给女的。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x76722A21D16A9777","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1210715013:0":{"text":"어이! 아까 네가 한 거짓말 때문에 이 여잔 지금 널 죽여버리고 싶을 거야. 네 운명이 달린 밧줄을 이 여자한테 줄 건데, 과연 너를 살려줄지, 죽게 내버려둘지 한번 보자고. 재밌겠지?","source_cn":"嘿！你刚骗了她，她恨不能杀了你。我把掌握你命运的绳子给...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3C18754B4B5939FA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:74:1210715014:0":{"text":"안 돼! 그러지마! 난 그럼 죽을 거야... 제발, 제발!","source_cn":"不！别！我会死的——不要，不要！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3095E8530D68DD43","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1210715015:0":{"text":"하하하...! 나한테 빌지 말고, 이 여자한테 빌어야지!","source_cn":"哈哈哈哈……！求我，不如求她！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE10F73EC4577C96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":